  "notes": "Story order follows Disney+'s MCU timeline as given by Tom's Guide (2026 edition): Loki and What If...? sit right after Endgame although they range over the whole timeline; VisionQuest (October 2026) is not placed by that list yet and sits at the end of the story order. Deadpool & Wolverine and The Fantastic Four: First Steps are set in other universes and are placed where that list puts them (First Steps' 1960s Earth-828 after Captain America: The First Avenger). Disney+ series are optional, each one entry placed by its first season. Left out: one-shots, Werewolf by Night and the Holiday Special (specials), the Netflix Defenders shows, Agent Carter/Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D., Eyes of Wakanda, Marvel Zombies, Your Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man and X-Men '97 (animated, outside the main line), and Avengers: Doomsday (not out until December 2026)."
